                    {
                      "source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/systemd/systemd/v257/man/systemctl.xml",
                      "locator": "--state"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "detail": "With no operand or a unit glob, match load, active or substate names. An explicit unit name is looked up directly. Ubuntu 24.04 and 26.04 require a value after =."
        },
